                  <tbody>
                    <tr><td>Empty neighborhoods never start</td><td>Seed listings and neighbors before the map goes live</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>New users land on an empty map</td><td>Three onboarding screens, then the three closest items</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>The map shuts out screen reader users</td><td>List view as an equal; default when a screen reader is on</td></tr>
                  </tbody>
